s7-4-p6 : Block
s7-4-p6 = prose (cons "For a differentiable numerical program, automatic differentiation is a transformation on its construction, governed by the chain rule and the chosen numeric semantics. A GPU compiler may subsequently realize either the original program or its derivative on the accelerator. The derivative is not fundamentally a GPU operation; the accelerator is not fundamentally a differentiable-programming operation. Both are constructions that compose when their types and semantic laws permit it." nil)
